  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of squares of all real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math>, for which the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>αx</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> do not form a triangle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>, then the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is ________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "32",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>αx</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>These lines will not form a triangle if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>αx</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is concurrent with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or parallel to either of them.</p><p>Case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>: Concurrent lines</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>: Parallel lines</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>"
  }
}